{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "fdee334ffb83ce9eef8dbe806f4aeda50681ab2556d4250ab5be50b537b4b9ab", "ja": "ふぅ……。うん、いいタイムが出たぞ。\nよーし、休憩したらもう一回っ！", "zh": "呼……嗯，成绩不错嘛。\n好——休息一下再来一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2600d3f60edfc497dee6d3aa7d64b30e8211b9de3d46ac2a0df4725fe1758231", "ja": "……あれ、響。どうしたんだ、こんなところで？\n仕事も終わったし、てっきり帰ったものだと……。", "zh": "……咦，响。你怎么会在这种地方？\n工作也结束了，我还以为你已经回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "7203fe478a82da4f046047488edf4a6d318952fd2963bb77958aa7dd2be253f1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。お疲れ様！\nちょっと自主練をね……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。辛苦啦！\n我刚才稍微自主练习了一下……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "f6c2de9627724b8ca5845f7158f535a604cd715281a968a2483e2b7ea66be3bd", "ja": "もうすぐ、アイドル大運動会があるでしょ？\nそれに向けて、劇場の周りを走ってたんだ！", "zh": "马上不是要举办偶像大运动会了吗？\n为了做准备，我刚才在剧场周围跑步呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9144afb09f6551d9f18a090d89c96fdc5c44620ab21f92c4bc9eced535faf1ff", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nわざわざ自主練をするなんて、すごい気合いだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n居然还特意自主训练，干劲真足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1ef7b302e33e164ea7608d732f3bebb192bce64895782840aad5768e25b33d54", "ja": "当然さー！　自分たちだけじゃなくて、\nたくさんのアイドルが参加する大会でしょ？", "zh": "那是当然啦！这不仅只有我们，\n还有很多偶像都会参加的大会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "bf1919beb157dd0ab7b78cf82a2e0ca93286cf2cbc034a9ad4e5ddb11d3b912d", "ja": "トップアイドルを目指すなら、\nたとえ運動会でも、一番を狙わないとね！", "zh": "既然目标是顶尖偶像，就算是运动会，也要争第一才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7316f79935b00068327089392b72692f2b8870819e5e14294d981d83f7e581a4", "ja": "ははっ。負けず嫌いな響らしいな。", "zh": "哈哈，真是争强好胜的响啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "df95c285851bc7d4ebccdc5e68c1df97b9585089a53c8b48a7960d9afd2fd622", "ja": "えへへ。それに騎馬戦の大将として、\n仲間を勝利に導くのも、自分の役目だし……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。而且，作为骑马战的主将，带领伙伴们取得胜利也是我的职责嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "fad0532e1bc2437692e91d0e9ff0acc58743c0f0681b1685d9917c445d3f513f", "ja": "自分だけじゃなくて、劇場のみんなと一番になりたい\nなって。そのためなら、いくらでも頑張れるさー！", "zh": "我不只是想成为第一，还想和剧场的大家一起成为第一。为了这个目标，无论努力多少次我都愿意啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5377355283080ddf1ea5d4202dc31f2d8248b9823c99620bfe902fac2e3d75d1", "ja": "そんなことまで考えて……。よし、わかった！\nそういうことなら、響の自主練を手伝わせてくれ！", "zh": "居然连这些都考虑到了……好，我明白了！\n既然这样，就让我来帮响自主练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "e813031955db196b403eed6c7c9f877c65126d2da226aaf914cca4fe6fe11963", "ja": "え？　{$P$}、協力してくれるの？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，你愿意帮我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c24cfc036bc7e061c185c53fb57309372208a6bf5b2b26873cb57fbbf061c54d", "ja": "ああ。全アイドルに勝って、トップを目指すんだろ？\nなら俺も、プロデューサーとして手伝いたいんだ。", "zh": "啊。你是想战胜所有偶像，向顶峰进发吧？\n那我也想以制作人的身份，助你一臂之力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1013_p", "source_sha256": "299e9b21c961bef4f0cc8ac20deea14aa030e258c20af35a93f03887bde96bf4", "ja": "まあ、運動に関することだし、\nあまり力にはなれないかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "不过，毕竟是运动相关的事，\n我也许帮不上什么忙就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "7c49fddf64dc3e2860fb7ece13600f492bbce9d0be5e9fdd79a56ef2afec2f6e", "ja": "ううん、そんなことない！　{$P$}が\n側にいてくれるだけで百人力だぞ！", "zh": "不，不是那样！　只要{$P$}陪在身边，\n就有百人之力啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "2fc7d413f14985510cd57ef63896d188be5882f1bd7b8619d37c19030e90bdff", "ja": "よ～し、それじゃもう一回！\n{$P$}も一緒に走ってくれるよね♪", "zh": "好～的，那就再来一次！\n{$P$}也会陪我一起跑的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0433_1016_p", "source_sha256": "139b733a011979ae9ae3ecefc37db96e069327eb5dd43b998701689282907dca", "ja": "（自主練の成果もあり……アイドル大運動会では\n見事な活躍だった！　よく頑張ったな、響！）", "zh": "（多亏自主训练的成果……在偶像大运动会上表现得非常出色！干得好，响！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
